<h3>@T("Certifications", "Certifications")</h3>
<div class="mini-cards">
    <div class="mini-card">
        <h4>Claude Academy · Anthropic <span class="tag tag-live">@T("6 certificats", "6 certificates")</span></h4>
        <ul class="list">
            <li>Building with the Claude API</li>
            <li>Claude Code in action</li>
            <li>Introduction to Model Context Protocol</li>
            <li>Introduction to evals</li>
            <li>AI capabilities and limitations</li>
            <li>Building effective human-agent teams</li>
        </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="mini-card">
        <h4>LinkedIn Learning <span class="tag tag-live">@T("4 certificats", "4 certificates")</span></h4>
        <ul class="list" lang="fr">
            <li>Les fondements de la programmation</li>
            <li>Examen blanc pour la préparation à la certification CAPM®</li>
            <li>Créer et lancer sa startup avec des ressources limitées</li>
            <li>L'IA et le cerveau humain : Reprendre le contrôle de son attention</li>
        </ul>
        @if (En)
        {
            <p class="small-print">Course titles are in French: programming fundamentals, a CAPM® practice exam, launching a startup, AI and attention.</p>
        }
    </div>
</div>

<h3>@T("Distinctions et diplômes", "Awards and diplomas")</h3>
<div class="mini-cards">
    <div class="mini-card">
        <h4>@T("2e place · Workshop National IoT", "2nd place · National IoT Workshop") <span class="tag tag-gold">@T("Trophée", "Trophy")</span></h4>
        <p>@T("Boîte à lecture NFC, projet de groupe : lecture de tags sur Raspberry Pi, servomoteurs pilotés par Arduino, interface Tkinter.",
              "NFC reading box, team project: tag reading on a Raspberry Pi, Arduino-driven servo motors, Tkinter interface.")</p>
    </div>
    <div class="mini-card">
        <h4>@T("BTS SIO option SLAM", "BTS SIO, SLAM option") <span class="tag">@T("Session 2027", "2027 exams")</span></h4>
        <p>@T("Diplôme d'État (certification RNCP de niveau 5) en développement d'applications, préparé à l'EPSI Lyon.",
              "French national diploma (RNCP level 5 certification) in application development, prepared at EPSI Lyon.")</p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="links">
    <a class="link-btn" href="./#certifications" target="_top">@T("Les certifications sur le portfolio", "Certifications on the portfolio")</a>
    <ExtLink Href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/ernest-afaton-1280a4361/details/certifications/">@T("Sur LinkedIn", "On LinkedIn")</ExtLink>
</div>

